    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "VERY SPACIOUS 2 BED / 2 BATH FIRST FLOOR HOME C. 80 SQ M SOUTH FACING BALCONY EXCELLENT CONDITION THROUGHOUT WELL MAINTAINED DEVELOPMENT AND NOT OVER LOOKED BEAUTIFUL LANDSCAPED COMMUNAL GARDENS EARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED.\r\n\r\nExtra spacious home in this most popular gated development\tLWK are truly delighted to present this extra spacious home to the Clarehall property market. No. 36 offers a fantastic opportunity to acquire an extra spacious home in a most secluded position. The extra spacious floor plan will appeal to first time buyers, investors and parties trading down alike. The accommodation of No. 36 consists of a warm inviting Entrance hallway with ample storage, store and utility room, an open plan kitchen/living / dining room complimented by a south facing balcony which is not overlooked, 2 spacious double bedrooms to include master en suite and family bathroom. Off the living room is a large 11 sq m private balcony with a most enviable south orientation. There is a designated underground parking space. The location is second to none within close proximity of a wealth of local amenities to include Northside / Clarehall Shopping Centres, The Malahide Rd and Dublin International Airport. There is also an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools within the immediate area and the coast is within 10 minutes. There is an excellent bus service quite literally on your doorstep offering a high frequency service to the City Centre. Early viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
